  "YangsThoughts": "This one’s got mobility and firepower in all the right places. Those two Large Pulse Lasers give it accurate punch without worrying about ammo, while the iATM-12 can load whatever missiles the situation calls for. Add the Nova CEWS and those jump jets, and this Grand Summoner can be a real pain to pin down.",
